{"1510330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dragonhold", "steam_appid": 1510330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>FAQ</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Q: Can I play this fully solo?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A</strong>: Yes. Dragonhold is fully playable as a single-player ARPG; co-op is optional.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Q: Is this pay-to-win?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A:</strong> No. All gameplay content and progression systems are included in the base game. We only sell a few optional cosmetic skins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Q: How does Multiplayer work?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A:</strong> Dedicated servers run by you, your friends, or others in the community. You can download the server tool from Steam for free, and configure the server how you like. We did this so there's never any issue with the game being &quot;turned off&quot;; you will always be able to run a server yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Q: What are the In-App Purchases .MTX</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A:  You can play the full experience from start to finish with the base purchase. We offer a <strong>small number of optional cosmetic skins</strong> for players who want to support development further. They don’t affect stats or progression in any way and never will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Q: Is this game &quot;always on&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: No, you  play solo and offline whenever you like, and only online if you want to. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Q: Is this an open world game?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A:</strong> Dragonhold uses large expedition zones rather than one continuous open world. Each zone is built around objectives, loot, bosses, extraction points, and dragon traversal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/19abe1a26dc0a334adc21e9eb9051db5.poster.avif?t=1786133714\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/19abe1a26dc0a334adc21e9eb9051db5.webm?t=1786133714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/19abe1a26dc0a334adc21e9eb9051db5.mp4?t=1786133714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/0d37cf51d6a8397076511b53625dc2cc.avif?t=1786133714\" width=616 height=74 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dragon-riding extraction ARPG with castle building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragonhold is a mission-based dragon riding ARPG. Take on dangerous excursions across the war-torn Azarkeen region, fighting on dragonback and on foot to seize loot and relics. Then <strong>extract back to your castle island</strong>, where you expand your town, craft gear, and upgrade your warriors for the next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission is a risk–reward run: push deeper for better rewards, or extract early to secure what you’ve found. Play fully <strong>solo</strong> or team up in <strong>online co-op</strong>; your progress and castle carry across both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragonhold is NOT always online. You can run a dedicated server yourself for free, the files are on steam.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Ride and fight on dragons</strong> – Soar over battlefields, strafe enemies with fire, then dive into brutal close-quarters combat as a dragon rider.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Mission-based extraction loop</strong> – Choose your mission, hunt for loot and materials, then extract safely or risk  going deeper.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Rebuild Dragonhold castle</strong> – Restore a ruined stronghold and surrounding town; unlock vendors, crafting stations, and new progression systems as you rebuild.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft and upgrade</strong> – Forge weapons, armor, and arcane relics. Grow your dragon’s power and your own build with skills and gear.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses and elite encounters</strong> – Take on challenging bosses both on dragonback and on foot, learning patterns and coordinating with allies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/65dedf0328e012b58c92212e4b2cdce5.avif?t=1786133714\" width=616 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the skies on a mighty dragon and unleash fiery attacks on your enemies. Explore a vast enchanted realm and save the people of Azarkeen. Unleash deadly abilities and magical powers to prevent a corrupt holy war spreading across the world. Restore the balance in spectacular third-person action in solo or multiplayer modes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play solo or with friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragonhold is <strong>fully playable solo from start to finish</strong> – you don’t need other players or a constant online population to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play offline / privately</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Host your own dedicated server </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Or join other servers from the community.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Co-op is there if you want it; the entire experience can be enjoyed as a single-player ARPG.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/1d47c41772fae20394ef72abe168e042.avif?t=1786133714\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/5bbbfe4ddd9e51b33028cdc5d4a5cc19.poster.avif?t=1786133714\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/5bbbfe4ddd9e51b33028cdc5d4a5cc19.webm?t=1786133714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/5bbbfe4ddd9e51b33028cdc5d4a5cc19.mp4?t=1786133714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/f30965f30b815cc22f029990ec49babe.avif?t=1786133714\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/09e290032195e9adc17600a9bc98dece.poster.avif?t=1786133714\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/09e290032195e9adc17600a9bc98dece.webm?t=1786133714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/09e290032195e9adc17600a9bc98dece.mp4?t=1786133714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/f9f6f25ae6d935ade682bb90dbd55f99.avif?t=1786133714\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/214d5ad1726bc2c92f6db82499eede44.poster.avif?t=1786133714\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/214d5ad1726bc2c92f6db82499eede44.webm?t=1786133714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/214d5ad1726bc2c92f6db82499eede44.mp4?t=1786133714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Are you ready to become a member of the legendary Boundless Order, harnessing the power of dragons and etching your name into the annals of history? Your destiny awaits in Dragonhold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/cae818851c4cc5805e9cb36411deaa27.poster.avif?t=1786133714\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/cae818851c4cc5805e9cb36411deaa27.webm?t=1786133714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/cae818851c4cc5805e9cb36411deaa27.mp4?t=1786133714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/19abe1a26dc0a334adc21e9eb9051db5.poster.avif?t=1786133714\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/19abe1a26dc0a334adc21e9eb9051db5.webm?t=1786133714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/19abe1a26dc0a334adc21e9eb9051db5.mp4?t=1786133714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/0d37cf51d6a8397076511b53625dc2cc.avif?t=1786133714\" width=616 height=74 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dragon-riding extraction ARPG with castle building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragonhold is a mission-based dragon riding ARPG. Take on dangerous excursions across the war-torn Azarkeen region, fighting on dragonback and on foot to seize loot and relics. Then <strong>extract back to your castle island</strong>, where you expand your town, craft gear, and upgrade your warriors for the next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission is a risk–reward run: push deeper for better rewards, or extract early to secure what you’ve found. Play fully <strong>solo</strong> or team up in <strong>online co-op</strong>; your progress and castle carry across both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragonhold is NOT always online. You can run a dedicated server yourself for free, the files are on steam.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Ride and fight on dragons</strong> – Soar over battlefields, strafe enemies with fire, then dive into brutal close-quarters combat as a dragon rider.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Mission-based extraction loop</strong> – Choose your mission, hunt for loot and materials, then extract safely or risk  going deeper.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Rebuild Dragonhold castle</strong> – Restore a ruined stronghold and surrounding town; unlock vendors, crafting stations, and new progression systems as you rebuild.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft and upgrade</strong> – Forge weapons, armor, and arcane relics. Grow your dragon’s power and your own build with skills and gear.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses and elite encounters</strong> – Take on challenging bosses both on dragonback and on foot, learning patterns and coordinating with allies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/65dedf0328e012b58c92212e4b2cdce5.avif?t=1786133714\" width=616 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the skies on a mighty dragon and unleash fiery attacks on your enemies. Explore a vast enchanted realm and save the people of Azarkeen. Unleash deadly abilities and magical powers to prevent a corrupt holy war spreading across the world. Restore the balance in spectacular third-person action in solo or multiplayer modes. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play solo or with friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragonhold is <strong>fully playable solo from start to finish</strong> – you don’t need other players or a constant online population to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play offline / privately</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Host your own dedicated server </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Or join other servers from the community.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Co-op is there if you want it; the entire experience can be enjoyed as a single-player ARPG.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/1d47c41772fae20394ef72abe168e042.avif?t=1786133714\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/5bbbfe4ddd9e51b33028cdc5d4a5cc19.poster.avif?t=1786133714\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/5bbbfe4ddd9e51b33028cdc5d4a5cc19.webm?t=1786133714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/5bbbfe4ddd9e51b33028cdc5d4a5cc19.mp4?t=1786133714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/f30965f30b815cc22f029990ec49babe.avif?t=1786133714\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/09e290032195e9adc17600a9bc98dece.poster.avif?t=1786133714\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/09e290032195e9adc17600a9bc98dece.webm?t=1786133714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/09e290032195e9adc17600a9bc98dece.mp4?t=1786133714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/f9f6f25ae6d935ade682bb90dbd55f99.avif?t=1786133714\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><